{"id":"wb-7-1748","name":"亭江炮台","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"亭江炮台","text":"亭江炮台，位于中华人民共和国福建省福州市马尾区亭江镇亭头南般村，为一个省级文物保护单位，类型为古建筑及历史纪念建筑物，为第三批福建省文物保护单位，公布时间为1991年4月17日。\n亭江炮台的历史年代为清。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%AD%E6%B1%9F%E7%82%AE%E5%8F%B0","revisionId":86761292,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86761292","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/6b748fde3bdb51f24bbe354a.jpg","title":"亭江炮台_-_Tingjiang_Fort_-_2015.08_-_panoramio.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BA%AD%E6%B1%9F%E7%82%AE%E5%8F%B0_-_Tingjiang_Fort_-_2015.08_-_panoramio.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5a/%E4%BA%AD%E6%B1%9F%E7%82%AE%E5%8F%B0_-_Tingjiang_Fort_-_2015.08_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"rheins","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"亭江炮台 - Tingjiang Fort - 2015.08","width":320,"height":240}}